समकोण त्रिभुज में,

\[
\cos A=\sqrt{1-\sin^2 A}
=\sqrt{1-\left(\frac34\right)^2}
=\sqrt{\frac{7}{16}}
=\frac{\sqrt7}{4}
\]

अब,

\[
\tan A=\frac{\sin A}{\cos A}
=\frac{3/4}{\sqrt7/4}
=\frac{3}{\sqrt7}
=\frac{3\sqrt7}{7}
\]

अतः,

\[
\boxed{\cos A=\frac{\sqrt7}{4}},\qquad
\boxed{\tan A=\frac{3\sqrt7}{7}}
\]

